---
description: Project rules for the budget app — always apply
alwaysApply: true
---

This repository has binding rules. Before writing or changing code:

- Read `CLAUDE.md` and follow it exactly. It is the project's rulebook, not
  specific to any one tool. `CONSTRAINTS.md` lists what the checks enforce.
- Read `HANDOFF.md` for current state, the owner's pending setup, and the
  prioritised list of remaining work.
- Run `./scripts/gates.sh full` before every commit and commit only on
  `status=GREEN`. Never weaken a gate, threshold, test or rule to get there.
- All arithmetic in `packages/core`; money as integer cents; nothing a model
  produces reaches the ledger without the user approving it.
- The owner is not an engineer: explain in plain language and make routine
  engineering calls yourself.
